{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Art House, step into the life of Lisa, mother to Ollie and Zoe, who's struggling to pick up the pieces of her life after the passing of her mother, Betty. After returning to Betty's mountain home, Lisa and her kids get trapped inside of Betty's paintings where her memories come to life. Guide Lisa through hauntingly beautiful paintings while solving puzzles and confronting the shadows of the family\u2019s past. Navigate a journey through grief and towards healing that lingers after the final brushstroke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D environments inspired by Impressionism and Post-Impressionism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles combining platforming, object manipulation, and strategic enemy avoidance</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic layer-switching through painting rips to navigate foreground and background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical paintbrush mechanics to restore broken objects, move platforms, and repaint the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemy types with unique behaviors, including patrolling, lurking, and rip-chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully voice-acted, narrative-driven experience told through  memories and evolving paintings</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I'll Remember, Mom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3532010/3a3280e5c0d85823563df9bc42d7dc859b5d5eaa.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532010?t=1771266374","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3532010?t=1771266374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532010/b913a98d122dd6dce5855305169e62cb1c4c2417/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771266374","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532010/b913a98d122dd6dce5855305169e62cb1c4c2417/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771266374","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Art House contains narrative themes involving death, memory loss, and the emotional impact of grief. Sensitive players should be aware that the game deals with cognitive deterioration and loss, though all story moments are presented thoughtfully and can be skipped."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Art House, step into the life of Lisa, mother to Ollie and Zoe, who's struggling to pick up the pieces of her life after the passing of her mother, Betty. After returning to Betty's mountain home, Lisa and her kids get trapped inside of Betty's paintings where her memories come to life. Guide Lisa through hauntingly beautiful paintings while solving puzzles and confronting the shadows of the family\u2019s past. Navigate a journey through grief and towards healing that lingers after the final brushstroke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D environments inspired by Impressionism and Post-Impressionism</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles combining platforming, object manipulation, and strategic enemy avoidance</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic layer-switching through painting rips to navigate foreground and background</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical paintbrush mechanics to restore broken objects, move platforms, and repaint the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemy types with unique behaviors, including patrolling, lurking, and 